# Dark Knight's Greatsword: job select makes a 1/1 Hero and attaches the Greatsword to it: "Equipped creature gets +3/+0 and
# is a Knight in addition to its other types", so the Hero is a 4/1 Hero Knight. Chaosbringer, "Equip - Pay 3 life.
# Activate only once each turn" (CR 702.6a, 602.5): on turn 1 it moves to Bot1's Ornithopter (0/2 Thopter, becoming a 3/2
# Thopter Knight) for 3 life, and a second equip the same turn is refused; the Hero is a 1/1 Hero again. On turn 3 it is
# offered again and moves back to the Hero for 3 more life, 14.

